er Mayhem:<i> Ikki Unite</i> can be played by up to 16 players simultaneously in online cooperation. Create your squad joining Gonbe, the forty-something vigilante, Magoichi, the trigger-happy legend and many others!<br><br>4 Classes: Play as one of the four archetypes: Explorers, Attackers, Enhancers and Healers! <br><br>Epic Action: So much action, you\u2019ll forget you\u2019re playing what was once dubbed the worst NES game ever.<br><br>Roguelite Madness: A different adventure every time you play, chose between a wide set of randomized items and bonuses! Because predictability is so 1985. [ And you don\u2019t even have to put another coin in ;)]<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061150/extras/42f9b338a0644c6f0b02fadd852e43e5.poster.avif?t=1715866381\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061150/extras/42f9b338a0644c6f0b02fadd852e43e5.webm?t=1715866381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061150/extras/42f9b338a0644c6f0b02fadd852e43e5.mp4?t=1715866381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Survival Tips for the Hopelessly Outnumbered:</strong><br><br>The Buddy System: Stick with your team. Or at least try to find them before the final boss does.<br>There's strength in unity: Even bigger enemies can be taken down when the squad is united and working together.<br>Resurrection: Fallen comrades can be brought back to life, don\u2019t leave them behind!<br><br><strong>SUNSOFT: The Dawn of a New Era</strong><br><br>SUNSOFT is back, dusting off the NES cartridges and leaping into the modern era with<i> Ikki Unite</i>. It\u2019s a love letter to the fans who stuck by us, an opportunity to make amends with those we have tortured, and an invitation to new players to join in the fun. Because if we can\u2019t laugh at ourselves, who can we laugh at?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061150/extras/7d52ee29eb0e059b81b05947b3fbc021.avif?t=1715866381\" /></div>",
